# Point-in-time audit output, not project documentation.
# A dated review folder is stale the moment its findings are fixed, and the reports quote the
# vulnerable code that was replaced. Durable outcomes belong in docs/memory/, where they are
# loaded deliberately; a `docs/reviews/` tree would be read as current truth and be wrong.
docs/reviews/
